  "analysis": "The status line 'Score:' and 'Moves:' are at y≈43 in the original 1280x720 frame, with 'Score:' at x≈768 and 'Moves:' at x≈973. The crop for status should be around x=750-1200, y=30-60. I need re-extract status crops with correct coordinates and OCR them to track move counts.",
